  "body": "Regarding `multipart/form-data`, HTML currently refers to RFC 2388, but that RFC has been obsoleted by [RFC 7578](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7578). HTML should thus be updated to refer to the new RFC.\nThe new RFC has an appendix explaining the changes since the old RFC: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7578#appendix-A\n",
